3618344967294,\"height\":0.01308142944733559,\"width\":0.2763419465797682,\"text\":\"edition is already the forty-second.\",\"y\":0.5872092853490066},{\"x\":0.12524850197908954,\"height\":0.01308148474180737,\"width\":0.6998011951140541,\"text\":\"The recent issues of the Star have gone through many significant changes especially in\",\"y\":0.6017441409788215},{\"x\":0.12518585465899007,\"height\":0.015363780217372613,\"width\":0.7575686857662098,\"text\":\"the presentation which is always of the utmost importance. In the past, there used to be long\",\"y\":0.614025067519787},{\"x\":0.32604375314557194,\"height\":0.014534954605351036,\"width\":0.5546719420189952,\"text\":\"descriptive essays on every page; phorographs were'occasionally’ seen.\",\"y\":0.6279069415442238},{\"x\":0.1252485146241925,\"height\":0.013081420749328831,\"width\":0.20278329560250946,\"text\":\"However, with the lapse\",\"y\":0.6293604524887076},{\"x\":0.12326045811018274,\"height\":0.013081491575955617,\"width\":0.7594433136802307,\"text\":\"of time, the recent issues have shown a tendency to put in more photographs to displace the dull\",\"y\":0.6424418124242315},{\"x\":0.12723660394771508,\"height\":0.013081484120521236,\"width\":0.6978130918560606,\"text\":\"And this year, realizing the importance of putting in more colourful photographs, we\",\"y\":0.6569766997820359},{\"x\":0.1272365993474781,\"height\":0.011628003695111966,\"width\":0.7534791127033199,\"text\":\"are further curtailing the unnecessary and often irrelevant words, aiming at restorine a balance\",\"y\":0.6700580912725991},{\"x\":0.1252485201989576,\"height\":0.013081491575955617,\"width\":0.7574552648207721,\"text\":\"between the two, both of which have been proved vital in recording our memorable events and\",\"y\":0.6845929751604234},{\"x\":0.7276341968866327,\"height\":0.0116279266556234,\"width\":0.15506957899015428,\"text\":\"imprinted moments.\",\"y\":0.6976744086198627},{\"x\":0.12723660611183807,\"height\":0.01162798381395369,\"width\":0.5984095065138981,\"text\":\"Besides, a new section, the Interschool Academic Contests, has been open-\",\"y\":0.6991278685944766},{\"x\":0.1709741674037693,\"height\":0.013081486605665882,\"width\":0.7117295970678754,\"text\":\"ed in an endeavour to separate those competitions from our routine student activities.\",\"y\":0.7122092569151903},{\"x\":0.12524852741940595,\"height\":0.014534980699371425,\"width\":0.7554671615627785,\"text\":\"praclice of such a sectionalization, we hope, will make the magazine much clearer and thus more\",\"y\":0.725290649366884},{\"x\":0.12524850970359686,\"height\":0.014534980699371425,\"width\":0.757455264820772,\"text\":\"readable. Most delightful of all is that four colour pages are put in spite of the heavy extra\",\"y\":0.7398255331483763},{\"x\":0.8190353864105544,\"height\":0.009120135975194676,\"width\":0.06371849318451628,\"text\":\"expense.\",\"y\":0.7556143506847315},{\"x\":0.12524851039395948,\"height\":0.013081484120521125,\"width\":0.7017892439735127,\"text\":\"Some students, as we know, still have the impression that the$STAR'is nothing but an\",\"y\":0.7674418160247685},{\"x\":0.125248498106513,\"height\":0.013081491575955506,\"width\":0.757455264820772,\"text\":\"ordinary book. Bur have they ever realized how invaluable the“STAR'will become one day\",\"y\":0.7805232076277199},{\"x\":0.12524853287003535,\"height\":0.013081491575955617,\"width\":0.7554671615627785,\"text\":\"when they have to leave Wah Yan? In fact, to all the members of our community, both\",\"y\":0.7950580914818866},{\"x\":0.1252485201989576,\"height\":0.013081491575955617,\"width\":0.7574552648207721,\"text\":\"present and past, theSTAR'is a real and irreplaceable star in the dark sky. It hangs alone\",\"y\":0.8081394868610048},{\"x\":0.12524850543752666,\"height\":0.015988468580214854,\"width\":0.7574552648207721,\"text\":\"but glitrers so brightly that all their past is lit up. No doubt, whenever you turn those pages，\",\"y\":0.82267437056091},{\"x\":0.5107398787359428,\"height\":0.017747145910604667,\"width\":0.3721320004386698,\"text\":\"your past will come alive again in your mind.\",\"y\":0.8334640178423021},{\"x\":0.12524851214843272,\"height\":0.013081484120521125,\"width\":0.7017892439735127,\"text\":\"Now that the school year has come to an end, nothing remains, except the 'STAR'that\",\"y\":0.8502906532159022},{\"x\":0.12524852968075925,\"height\":0.011628003695112077,\"width\":0.7594433136802305,\"text\":\"you are holding at this very moment. Whether it is a success depends on personal opinion but\",\"y\":0.8648255331233742},{\"x\":0.22852389970876763,\"height\":0.015480399364757202,\"width\":0.6562425474007074,\"text\":\"we do want to listen and note some comments and suggestions if there are any.\",\"y\":0.87657315045403},{\"x\":0.12723657063382796,\"height\":0.013081484120521125,\"width\":0.6998011951140541,\"text\":\"Last of all, we would like to thank our advertisers and past students whose advertise.\",\"y\":0.8909883276890127},{\"x\":0.12524850354885878,\"height\":0.013081491575955617,\"width\":0.7574552648207721,\"text\":\"ments and kind donations have lessened our fnancial burden. Nor must we forget to thank\",\"y\":0.9055232078639117},{\"x\":0.12524850315621452,\"height\":0.014534980699371425,\"width\":0.7574552648207721,\"text\":\"Fr.Barrett, our Principal, Fr. Grogan and Mr. Sixtus Cheung, our advisers, for their advice，\",\"y\":0.9186046026735701},{\"x\":0.39960238947285925,\"height\":0.014534945907344166,\"width\":0.4850894703584559,\"text\":\"guidance, and encouragement throughout the ediorial work.\",\"y\":0.9316860151761729},{\"x\":0.12326044042358379,\"height\":0.013081428204763212,\"width\":0.26043736530922734,\"text\":\"The SSTAR' '77 Editorial Board\",\"y\":0.9462209137198083},{\"x\":0.0735586414672383,\"height\":0.09593022747226188,\"width\":0.029821086482355735,\"text\":\"delorial\",\"y\":0.6976744219470086}]",
