        "text": "[{\"x\":0.2783300174805301,\"height\":0.014534903659882636,\"width\":0.15705765504888036,\"text\":\"Assistant Editors：\",\"y\":0.06104650184011673},{\"x\":0.355864809904777,\"height\":0.013081405217173825,\"width\":0.08151093481271238,\"text\":\"（L to R）\",\"y\":0.07558139004952003},{\"x\":0.36182902430868874,\"height\":0.008720939710784803,\"width\":0.07554672023616799,\"text\":\"Front Row\",\"y\":0.09738371614266961},{\"x\":0.24055666034188827,\"height\":0.015988397132301935,\"width\":0.19681908102596507,\"text\":\"Cheng Yiu Wai （L6A）\",\"y\":0.11046510360867101},{\"x\":0.16438405400819842,\"height\":0.02267256870331913,\"width\":0.2734175085383941,\"text\":\"Chan® Chun Fat, Francis （L6A）\",\"y\":0.11961005660378765},{\"x\":0.2624254448950375,\"height\":0.017441881906714363,\"width\":0.17495029877851354,\"text\":\"Tsang Joseph （L6A）\",\"y\":0.13808138484606147},{\"x\":0.36773003861877285,\"height\":0.01064662374192038,\"width\":0.06970890745547154,\"text\":\"Back Row\",\"y\":0.1611011066853617},{\"x\":0.21664592783412168,\"height\":0.012765581833034778,\"width\":0.21879562677121628,\"text\":\"wong huck Keung （L6S）\",\"y\":0.17675674362707805},{\"x\":0.39562624232205484,\"height\":0.010174423242624964,\"width\":0.04174950203581079,\"text\":\"Hau\",\"y\":0.1889534860288813},{\"x\":0.35188866776937094,\"height\":0.010174423242624964,\"width\":0.04174950203581079,\"text\":\"Tat\",\"y\":0.1889534860288813},{\"x\":0.16103379477475374,\"height\":0.01744188439185923,\"width\":0.19284294250814674,\"text\":\"Kwong, Andrew （L6S）\",\"y\":0.18895347662674478},{\"x\":0.26004352074982723,\"height\":0.01707599155289352,\"width\":0.1777484234216592,\"text\":\"To Tak Shun （L6S）\",\"y\":0.20036441669068528},{\"x\":0.24254473050284586,\"height\":0.0159883965110158,\"width\":0.1948310185668728,\"text\":\"Hui Tung Choi （L6A）\",\"y\":0.21511626690619268},{\"x\":0.24254473600292195,\"height\":0.01744188563443161,\"width\":0.1968190810259651,\"text\":\"Liu Hing Hung （L6A）\",\"y\":0.22819766161592359},{\"x\":0.7256461209010309,\"height\":0.013081404595887691,\"width\":0.07952286555380317,\"text\":\"Business\",\"y\":0.3851744139266201},{\"x\":0.6278163689924305,\"height\":0.014736591798863108,\"width\":0.09215037707976481,\"text\":\"Managers：\",\"y\":0.3864259348255872},{\"x\":0.6461232604979628,\"height\":0.017441880664141984,\"width\":0.16103379356669867,\"text\":\"Chow Wai Keung，\",\"y\":0.3982558040719988},{\"x\":0.5049701799765594,\"height\":0.01598838905558131,\"width\":0.13916501131924708,\"text\":\"Maurice （F.5B1）\",\"y\":0.39970929389880816},{\"x\":0.6302186899825888,\"height\":0.015988394025870933,\"width\":0.17693836123760587,\"text\":\"Luk Chi Lok （L6S）\",\"y\":0.41279068690784937},{\"x\":0.6493675354034276,\"height\":0.020713582489311877,\"width\":0.15847262894193548,\"text\":\"Chan Yuen Wing\",\"y\":0.42309949390420176},{\"x\":0.5924453251879334,\"height\":0.014534890612872498,\"width\":0.05168986532989883,\"text\":\"（L6A）\",\"y\":0.4287790661925136},{\"x\":0.5920572550929247,\"height\":0.020503318115632108,\"width\":0.21550758892202126,\"text\":\"Lai Mun Cheung （L6A）\",\"y\":0.43848112192185207},{\"x\":0.8954402937563667,\"height\":0.0800071045319497,\"width\":0.03445170907413253,\"text\":\"ritezia\",\"y\":0.6880799454688884},{\"x\":0.3749999997900197,\"height\":0.041666690689733166,\"width\":0.18750000000000006,\"text\":\"Shitsial\",\"y\":0.5124999880790464},{\"x\":0.12517890781367425,\"height\":0.016073549997534742,\"width\":0.7019168629365808,\"text\":\"Few Wah Yan boys know that the “Star” has had a much longer existence than they\",\"y\":0.5581055208021901},{\"x\":0.20079524143441646,\"height\":0.013081481635376369,\"width\":0.6799204345267937,\"text\":\"themselves. It is an amazing fact that it has been published for forty-one years，\",\"y\":0.574127863815306},{\"x\":0.12118016657649064,\"height\":0.013646671904026464,\"width\":0.07374304841121462,\"text\":\"and this\",\"y\":0.5723917804471548},{\"x\":0.6063618344967294,\"height\":0.01308142944733559,\"width\":0.2763419465797682,\"text\":\"edition is already the forty-second.\",\"y\":0.5872092853490066},{\"x\":0.12524850197908954,\"height\":0.01308148474180737,\"width\":0.6998011951140541,\"text\":\"The recent issues of the Star have gone through many significant changes especially in\",\"y\":0.6017441409788215},{\"x\":0.12518585465899007,\"height\":0.015363780217372613,\"width\":0.7575686857662098,\"text\":\"the presentation which is always of the utmost importance. In the past, there used to be long\",\"y\":0.614025067519787},{\"x\":0.32604375314557194,\"height\":0.014534954605351036,\"width\":0.5546719420189952,\"text\":\"descriptive essays on every page; phorographs were'occasionally’ seen.\",\"y\":0.6279069415442238},{\"x\":0.1252485146241925,\"height\":0.013081420749328831,\"width\":0.20278329560250946,\"text\":\"However, with the lapse\",\"y\":0.6293604524887076},{\"x\":0.12326045811018274,\"height\":0.013081491575955617,\"width\":0.7594433136802307,\"text\":\"of time, the recent issues have shown a tendency to put in more photographs to displace the dull\",\"y\":0.6424418124242315},{\"x\":0.12723660394771508,\"height\":0.013081484120521236,\"width\":0.6978130918560606,\"text\":\"And this year, realizing the importance of putting in more colourful photographs, we\",\"y\":0.6569766997820359},{\"x\":0.1272365993474781,\"height\":0.011628003695111966,\"width\":0.7534791127033199,\"text\":\"are further curtailing the unnecessary and often irrelevant words, aiming at restorine a balance\",\"y\":0.6700580912725991},{\"x\":0.1252485201989576,\"height\":0.013081491575955617,\"width\":0.7574552648207721,\"text\":\"between the two, both of which have been proved vital in recording our memorable events and\",\"y\":0.6845929751604234},{\"x\":0.7276341968866327,\"height\":0.0116279266556234,\"width\":0.15506957899015428,\"text\":\"imprinted moments.\",\"y\":0.6976744086198627},{\"x\":0.12723660611183807,\"height\":0.01162798381395369,\"width\":0.5984095065138981,\"text\":\"Besides, a new section, the Interschool Academic Contests, has been open-\",\"y\":0.6991278685944766},{\"x\":0.1709741674037693,\"height\":0.013081486605665882,\"width\":0.7117295970678754,\"text\":\"ed in an endeavour to separate those competitions from our routine student activities.\",\"y\":0.7122092569151903},{\"x\":0.12524852741940595,\"height\":0.014534980699371425,\"width\":0.7554671615627785,\"text\":\"praclice of such a sectionalization, we hope, will make the magazine much clearer and thus more\",\"y\":0.725290649366884},{\"x\":0.12524850970359686,\"height\":0.014534980699371425,\"width\":0.757455264820772,\"text\":\"readable. Most delightful of all is that four colour pages are put in spite of the heavy extra\",\"y\":0.7398255331483763},{\"x\":0.8190353864105544,\"height\":0.009120135975194676,\"width\":0.06371849318451628,\"text\":\"expense.\",\"y\":0.7556143506847315},{\"x\":0.12524851039395948,\"height\":0.013081484120521125,\"width\":0.7017892439735127,\"text\":\"Some students, as we know, still have the impression that the$STAR'is nothing but an\",\"y\":0.7674418160247685},{\"x\":0.125248498106513,\"height\":0.013081491575955506,\"width\":0.757455264820772,\"text\":\"ordinary book. Bur have they ever realized how invaluable the“STAR'will become one day\",\"y\":0.7805232076277199},{\"x\":0.12524853287003535,\"height\":0.013081491575955617,\"width\":0.7554671615627785,\"text\":\"when they have to leave Wah Yan? In fact, to all the members of our community, both\",\"y\":0.7950580914818866},{\"x\":0.1252485201989576,\"height\":0.013081491575955617,\"width\":0.7574552648207721,\"text\":\"present and past, theSTAR'is a real and irreplaceable star in the dark sky. It hangs alone\",\"y\":0.8081394868610048},{\"x\":0.12524850543752666,\"height\":0.015988468580214854,\"width\":0.7574552648207721,\"text\":\"but glitrers so brightly that all their past is lit up. No doubt, whenever you turn those pages，\",\"y\":0.82267437056091},{\"x\":0.5107398787359428,\"height\":0.017747145910604667,\"width\":0.3721320004386698,\"text\":\"your past will come alive again in your mind.\",\"y\":0.8334640178423021},{\"x\":0.12524851214843272,\"height\":0.013081484120521125,\"width\":0.7017892439735127,\"text\":\"Now that the school year has come to an end, nothing remains, except the 'STAR'that\",\"y\":0.8502906532159022},{\"x\":0.12524852968075925,\"height\":0.011628003695112077,\"width\":0.7594433136802305,\"text\":\"you are holding at this very moment. Whether it is a success depends on personal opinion but\",\"y\":0.8648255331233742},{\"x\":0.22852389970876763,\"height\":0.015480399364757202,\"width\":0.6562425474007074,\"text\":\"we do want to listen and note some comments and suggestions if there are any.\",\"y\":0.87657315045403},{\"x\":0.12723657063382796,\"height\":0.013081484120521125,\"width\":0.6998011951140541,\"text\":\"Last of all, we would like to thank our advertisers and past students whose advertise.\",\"y\":0.8909883276890127},{\"x\":0.12524850354885878,\"height\":0.013081491575955617,\"width\":0.7574552648207721,\"text\":\"ments and kind donations have lessened our fnancial burden. Nor must we forget to thank\",\"y\":0.9055232078639117},{\"x\":0.12524850315621452,\"height\":0.014534980699371425,\"width\":0.7574552648207721,\"text\":\"Fr.Barrett, our Principal, Fr. Grogan and Mr. Sixtus Cheung, our advisers, for their advice，\",\"y\":0.9186046026735701},{\"x\":0.39960238947285925,\"height\":0.014534945907344166,\"width\":0.4850894703584559,\"text\":\"guidance, and encouragement throughout the ediorial work.\",\"y\":0.9316860151761729},{\"x\":0.12326044042358379,\"height\":0.013081428204763212,\"width\":0.26043736530922734,\"text\":\"The SSTAR' '77 Editorial Board\",\"y\":0.9462209137198083},{\"x\":0.0735586414672383,\"height\":0.09593022747226188,\"width\":0.029821086482355735,\"text\":\"delorial\",\"y\":0.6976744219470086}]",
